{"data":[{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-10-07T05:18:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2107702063031529839"],"id":"2107702063031529839","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":27,"impression_count":11717,"like_count":329,"quote_count":7,"reply_count":57,"retweet_count":44},"text":"花了些时间终于跟喜欢的人登记在同一页纸上了，他们把这叫作凶手和被害，听起来和夫妻没有差别。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2107702063031529839"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-10-07T04:41:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2107692723604275243"],"id":"2107692723604275243","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1987,"like_count":25,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"我其实很享受那种打游戏打到进入一种疯魔了一样的状态，网也不上了什么事情都不想就是玩儿，最省钱饭什么样都无所谓扒两口回去接着玩，对我精神状态好。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2107692723604275243"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-10-06T20:16:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2107565632518840601"],"id":"2107565632518840601","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":19,"impression_count":19430,"like_count":639,"quote_count":6,"reply_count":146,"retweet_count":85},"text":"爱一个人恨一个人没关系，但是爱恨都是一个人就完蛋了。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2107565632518840601"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-10-06T19:16:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2107550590826143876"],"id":"2107550590826143876","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":1456,"like_count":25,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":2},"text":"眼泪不是为悲伤、愤怒、耻辱、冤屈、怨恨、不幸而准备的，眼泪是为在痛苦之上建立的幸福准备的","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2107550590826143876"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-10-06T14:34:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2107479704735555668"],"id":"2107479704735555668","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1281,"like_count":11,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"时间不是苦口的良药，痛苦的痕迹成为流着脓血的枷锁会永远的让人恐惧，进而退化成创伤。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2107479704735555668"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-10-06T14:31:35.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2107478882278584547"],"id":"2107478882278584547","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":2501,"like_count":60,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":2},"text":"在肉体极其痛苦的时候总会梦到你，像真实的又像虚幻的，我分不清，在你不在的时候我总是分不清","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2107478882278584547"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-10-06T11:44:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2107436776222871872"],"id":"2107436776222871872","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2102,"like_count":22,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":0},"text":"洗完胃之后看什么都好透彻，人生好通透…","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2107436776222871872"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-10-04T17:17:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2106795798432534919"],"id":"2106795798432534919","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2494,"like_count":41,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":4},"text":"于你而言或许我的叹息，我的忧虑都只是一厢情愿罢了，但即便如此，还是会期盼着，等待着，天真到愚蠢的你获得幸福的那一刻，因为哪怕只有一瞬，也想要看到你发自内心的笑容","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2106795798432534919"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-10-04T09:47:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2106682679278325871"],"id":"2106682679278325871","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1794,"like_count":24,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我是旧情人还是新知己。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2106682679278325871"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-10-03T15:29:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2106406274758070689"],"id":"2106406274758070689","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":3678,"like_count":64,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":7},"text":"我恨你 https://t.co/MkjxjWWkK8","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2106406274758070689"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-10-03T15:14:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2106402513020920116"],"id":"2106402513020920116","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":3493,"like_count":78,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":8},"text":"把永远挂在嘴边说出来的誓言总觉得是不可靠的，明明它是那样的难。永远在一起或是永远爱你之类的话，人类的躯体真的有办法保证吗。\n只是想如果眼泪已有一刻落在我们的心上在记忆里留下温度，那此刻也许便是永远了","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2106402513020920116"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-10-03T12:39:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2106363554026918028"],"id":"2106363554026918028","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":3709,"like_count":79,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":10},"text":"回忆可以删，那你的脸呢？也可以扇吗？","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2106363554026918028"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-10-03T07:40:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2106288191028568521"],"id":"2106288191028568521","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1530,"like_count":16,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":1},"text":"我终于懂什么叫咫尺天涯","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2106288191028568521"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-10-02T23:54:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2106171072882290748"],"id":"2106171072882290748","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":4198,"like_count":84,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":5},"text":"在感到痛苦的时候我就能分辨出来幸福是何物了","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2106171072882290748"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-10-02T18:34:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2106090336233947515"],"id":"2106090336233947515","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":2270,"like_count":47,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":3},"text":"一直在我身边吧，我对着月亮许过愿了。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2106090336233947515"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-10-02T06:56:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2105914760835576078"],"id":"2105914760835576078","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2332,"like_count":39,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":5},"text":"我拿尸块又重新拼凑出了一个新的你","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2105914760835576078"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-10-02T03:07:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2105857149322789249"],"id":"2105857149322789249","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2260,"like_count":22,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":1},"text":"https://t.co/isEJvt3dTg","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2105857149322789249"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-10-02T02:58:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2105854785274733038"],"id":"2105854785274733038","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1526,"like_count":25,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"所以你也会像我那时候一样到处收集过去的痕迹吗","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2105854785274733038"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-10-02T02:54:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2105853795381268857"],"id":"2105853795381268857","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":2857,"like_count":57,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":9},"text":"我总是不停的不停的想幸福是何物，但在这些思考里我只得到了痛苦","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2105853795381268857"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-10-02T02:51:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2105853078935384103"],"id":"2105853078935384103","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1793,"like_count":11,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":1},"text":"有很多事情我都有隐隐的预感。幸福时潜在危机的暗笑，我听到了，可什么也做不了，只能转头看你，把再见两个字拉到最长","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2105853078935384103"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-10-02T02:46:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2105851895785107767"],"id":"2105851895785107767","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":2316,"like_count":31,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":22,"retweet_count":1},"text":"对待入了心的感情我敏感脆弱 卑微 我习惯性成为低头者 留恋者 我恨自己的心软 我恨我自己为对方找的借口\n我很感谢你你让我脱离苦海 如果没你的狠心像我这种优柔寡断的性格是不会下定决心放弃的我相信很多事情有转机 都有可以回旋的余地","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2105851895785107767"}],"includes":{"users":[{"id":"1917047326990094336","name":"kiri","profile_image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1917047544313679872/akAJkXe1_normal.jpg","username":"0TwT012","verified":false}]},"meta":{"newest_id":"2107702063031529839","next_token":"b26v89c19zqg8o3juzixwevzsq6bvo2xwrspwbosgxnr1","oldest_id":"2105851895785107767","result_count":21}}